            {
              "id": "a8eb58c",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>Many Muslims encounter the Qur\u2019an devotionally, but have fewer opportunities to engage deeply with its stories, context and relevance to contemporary life. The programme creates a space to move beyond inspiration alone towards deeper understanding \u2014 particularly of how the Qur\u2019an speaks to women\u2019s experiences, trials, dignity and agency.</p>",
                "text_color": "#2A3B32",
                "typography_typography": "custom",
                "typography_font_family": "Manrope",
                "typography_font_size": {
                  "unit": "px",
