              "id": "17ff0f2",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>Participants are guided through key passages and themes from Surah Maryam, with scholarly explanation, reflection and contemporary application. The session combines a lecture by Shaykh Dr Mohammad Akram Nadwi, a moderated conversation with Nurul Izzah Anwar, and space for participants to engage with the ideas raised.</p>",
